From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Kristof Imeri <kristof@lanth.me>
Date: Tue, 3 Nov 2026 07:46:35 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 60/60] compositor: round the corners of maximized and tiled
 windows that face open space

Maximized and tiled windows lost all their rounding. When the shell keeps
a gap between a display's work area and its edge, as a floating taskbar
does, the corners facing that gap now stay rounded, while corners that
meet the screen or another window stay square. Each corner is clipped on
its own, and the shell says which displays leave a gap with
meta_compositor_set_monitor_gap().

Upstream-Status: luft-only Kestrel's floating taskbar
---
